      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e This behavior is the default for BFD.\n\nA bit clarification: the default behavior of GNU ld is on-demand DT_TEXTREL/DF_TEXTREL.\n-z notext alwayys adds DF_TEXTREL. On-demand DF_TEXTREL does not add the tag if it is not needed.\n\n (From GNU ld 2.35 onwards, the configure time --enable-textrel-check\u003derror is probably similar to LLD\u0027s current behavior)",
